     hole between a page and the line that closes it. The profile page brings
     its own 3rem/10rem of internal air (profile.css), which is the whole point
     of showing it unmodified. */
  .preview-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  /* The closing line under the directory card — same hairline
     ProfileViewPreview draws above and below the page, so the tab reads as one
